  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Pharmaceutical Laboratory Testing Program &#x2013; Phase Two</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving 12 Pacific island country &amp; Timor-Leste access to quality assured therapeutic goods. Assists Pacific Islands Countries (PICs) and Timor-Leste to access Australia&#x2019;s Therapeutic Goods Administration&#x2019;s (TGA) therapeutic goods quality testing laboratories, via a credit-based voucher system.  The investment value is estimated to be $1,977,552 over 4 years.</narrative>
  </description>
